{"at":"2026-02-18T16:08:25.019Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":733,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/security/","title":"Security","description":null,"body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\r\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"ezd-doc-badge\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMLS User Manual\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Security</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"read-time\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEstimated reading: 2 minutes\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"views sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t843 views\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10248\" class=\"elementor elementor-10248\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05610a9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"05610a9\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b1dc4e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4b1dc4e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><strong>PropertyList.es Security: Your Data is in Safe Hands</strong></h3><p>At PropertyList.es, we prioritise the security of your personal and property information. Our platform is fortified with state-of-the-art security technologies to ensure your data remains safe and secure.</p><p><strong>Top-Notch Security Measures:</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-67dac5e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"67dac5e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-af8bc2d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"af8bc2d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.cloudflare.com/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"393\" height=\"128\" src=\"/assets/6f69a3b6-5ce0-46dc-9e14-6fc94cdabb58\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-11726\" alt=\"cloudflare propertylist.es\" srcset=\"/assets/6f69a3b6-5ce0-46dc-9e14-6fc94cdabb58 393w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/cloudflare-propertylist.es_-300x98.png 300w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/cloudflare-propertylist.es_-20x7.png 20w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/cloudflare-propertylist.es_-32x10.png 32w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/cloudflare-propertylist.es_-18x6.png 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 393px) 100vw, 393px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-33e749d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"33e749d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a508d88 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a508d88\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul style=\"letter-spacing: 0.15px;\"><li><strong>Cloudflare Protection:</strong> We leverage Cloudflare’s advanced security solutions to shield our network from malicious attacks and ensure seamless, secure access to our services.</li><li><strong>Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA):</strong> Adding an extra layer of security, MFA helps protect your account by requiring multiple forms of verification before granting access.</li><li><strong>Intrusion Detection and Firewalls:</strong> Our networks are designed with robust intrusion detection systems and firewalls to monitor and block unauthorised access attempts.</li><li><strong>Regular Penetration Testing:</strong> We conduct frequent penetration tests to identify and address potential vulnerabilities, ensuring our defences are always up to date.</li><li><strong>24/7 Monitoring:</strong> Our security team continuously monitors our systems to detect and respond to any suspicious activity in real-time.</li></ul><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.15px;\">With these comprehensive security measures in place, you can trust that your data on PropertyList.es is protected against hackers and other threats. Your privacy and security are our top priorities, and we are committed to maintaining a safe and secure environment for all our users.</p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.15px;\">Stay connected and stay secure with PropertyList.es.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4e529a5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4e529a5\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-53d5472 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"53d5472\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>PLEAE NOTE</strong>: <br />PropertyList<strong> does not have access</strong> to any contacts, property documents, or pipeline info. This ensures that your information remains secure within your office. <strong>However, please be careful when deleting any items, as we are unable to retrieve deleted information either.</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"details_cont ent recently_added\" id=\"content_elements\"><h4 class=\"c_head\">Articles</h4><ul class=\"article_list\"><li class=\"page_item page-item-10266\"><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/security/complying-with-data-protection-regulations/\">Complying with Data Protection Regulations</a></li>\n<li class=\"page_item page-item-10267\"><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/security/incident-response/\">Incident Response</a></li>\n</ul></div>\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t    <div class=\"doc-btm\">\r\n                <div class=\"eazydocs-next-prev-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager first\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/reports-and-statistics/\">\r\n                    <span> MLS User Manual - Previous </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tReports &#038; Statistics                </a>\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager second\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/technical-documentation/\">\r\n                    <span> Next - MLS User Manual </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tTechnical Documentation                </a>\r\n\t\t\t        </div>\r\n\t\t    </div>\r\n    </article>","seo_title":"Security • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}